===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} For a [[complex number]] <math>a+bi</math>, the [[principal square root]] of the [[sum]] of the [[square]]s of its [[real]] and [[imaginary]] parts, <math>\sqrt{a^2+b^2}</math>. Denoted by | |. [[Category:en:Functions]]
#: The absolute value |x| of a real number x is <math>\sqrt{x^2}</math>, which is equal to x if x is non-negative, and −x if x is negative.

